{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CebfwBbSeoXYyyXGt22au","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Fixed! ✅\n\nAll 2374 tests now pass. I fixed two failing tests that were checking whether uWSGI protocol responses incorrectly include Transfer-Encoding headers.\n\n**Changes made:**\n\n1. **gunicorn/http/wsgi.py** - Modified `is_chunked()` to return False for uWSGI protocol since it doesn't use HTTP chunked encoding.\n\n2. **gunicorn/asgi/protocol.py** - Made three changes:\n   - Skip adding Transfer-Encoding: chunked for uWSGI responses\n   - Track whether response has proper framing (Content-Length/Transfer-Encoding/no-body)\n   - Refuse keepalive on responses without proper framing to prevent connection reuse when message boundaries can't be signaled\n\nThe fix ensures uWSGI responses are properly framed using raw body bytes with connection closure, not HTTP chunked encoding."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":561,"cache_read_input_tokens":67754,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":561},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54e9d7c1-1345-5e2d-ba67-93201e1134e8","uuid":"f6272591-2238-4e38-8a45-b92598ea7f07","timestamp":"2026-08-31T23:11:49.359Z","request_id":"req_011CebfwAjMDSNeuomkkX642"}
